```mermaid
%% Compact slide-friendly activity diagram
%% Use init to reduce node/rank spacing and a small font class
%%{init: {"theme":"base","flowchart": {"nodeSpacing": 24, "rankSpacing": 24, "curve":"linear"}}}%%
flowchart LR
  classDef small font-size:12px;

  Start([Start]) --> Create[Create]
  Create --> Valid{Valid?}
  Valid -->|yes| Save[Save]
  Valid -->|no| Error[Error]
  Save --> Notify[Notify]
  Notify --> Update[Update]
  Update --> Views[Views]
  Views --> Loop{Done?}
  Loop -->|no| UpdateStatus[Upd.]
  Loop -->|yes| Complete[Done]

  class Start,Create,Save,Notify,Update,Views,UpdateStatus,Complete,Error small

